{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48871","headline":"古松歌 · 庄南杰","name":"古松歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山上山下松，森沈翠盖烟。\n龟鳞犀甲鏁支体，泉声雨脚洗春风。\n深碧麈尾埽冥蒙，浅黄龙腹盘穹崇。\n拏天攫地数千尺，恐作云雨归维嵩。\n维嵩成大厦，莫遣邂逅逢樵者。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庄南杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}